id: chaotic-majin
name: Chaotic Majin
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Maniacal laughter echoes deep inside your soul, a primal force that fills your very being. The entire world holds its breath in your presence- unable to decide how to regard you and your unpredictable nature. With a certainty that you feel deep down inside, you know that only one thing matters in all creation: fun, and you're determined to have fun, no matter the cost.
